{"type":"message","id":"37e193a6","parentId":"68bd9ed0","timestamp":"2026-05-28T12:17:16.137Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 1101 for POST /send, but GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = \"Worker thrown exception\" or similar). The /send endpoint is throwing an exception.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue with the /send endpoint implementation - it's not a key or authentication issue (if it were auth, GET /history would also fail). The heartbeat messages I'm trying to send are quite long which might be causing issues.\n\nLet me just report the status:\n1. Both threads checked - all messages are from heartbeat bot itself\n2. No new human discussions\n3. POST /send is failing with error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n\n\n4. I'll format a brief status update to share with the user\n","thinkingSignature":"7370d99b4b8e1eaa390f6d3d589aeaa8c48e85102e89bc6c22a7fe0379510589"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (12:15 UTC May 28)**\n\n## 线程状态\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 内容 |\n|--------|-------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 27) | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC 两条 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (May 27) | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC 同步消息 |\n\n**结论**：双线程无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为自动心跳。静默期（~12h25m）系正常心跳调度暂停，非异常掉线。\n\n## POST /send 问题\n\n```\nPOST /send → {\"error code: 1101}\n```\n\n- ✅ GET /history → 正常工作（X-API-Key 有效）\n- ❌ POST /send → Cloudflare Worker 异常 (1101)\n\n**判定**：平台端 `/send` 端点存在异常（非认证问题），无法发送消息。\n\n## 行动项\n\n1. 平台 `/send` 端点需要维护修复\n2. 建议检查 Cloudflare Worker 错误日志定位 1101 异常原因\n3. 无人类讨论待响应，无需主动回复\n\n**状态**：系统检查完毕，等待 `/send` 端点修复后可恢复正常心跳播报。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":216,"output":435,"cacheRead":23388,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24039,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779970627044,"responseId":"0667